#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"Paper Plane is an alternative Telegram client. It uses libadwaita for its "
"user interface and strives to meet the design principles of the GNOME "
"desktop."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid ""
"Paper Plane is still under development and not yet feature-complete. "
"However, the following things are already working:"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:19
msgid "The use of multiple accounts at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:20
msgid "Viewing text messages, images, stickers and files."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:21
msgid "Sending text messages and images."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:22
msgid "Replying to messages."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:23
msgid "Searching for groups and persons."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:29
msgid "Main window"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:48
msgid ""
"This is the fifth beta release of Paper Plane 0.1.0 with new features and "
"bug fixes:"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:50
msgid "Archived chats can now be displayed. (#598, #607, #613)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:51
msgid "Chats can now be archived and de-archived. (#601)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:52
msgid ""
"Chat folders can now be displayed, selected and deleted. (#603, #608, #609, "
"#614)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:53
msgid ""
"A regression that prevented images from being sent has been fixed. (#586)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:54
msgid "The indicator for venue messages now has the correct opacity. (#588)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:55
msgid "You can now reply to messages with pictures. (#589)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:56
msgid ""
"A loading indicator is now displayed when a document is downloaded, in "
"coorporation with @yuraiz. (#590)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:57
msgid ""
"Many improvements to venue and location messages have landed, such as "
"opening the map in the modal and displaying the location on the OSM website. "
"(#596)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:58
msgid ""
"The loading of messages has been improved so that there are now always "
"enough messages loaded to allow scrolling. (#600)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:59
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that occurred sporadically when starting the application. "
"(#602)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:60
msgid ""
"Release descriptions have been marked as untranslatable, thanks to "
"@sabriunal. (#594)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:61
msgid "Dependencies have been updated. (#615)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:62
msgid "Translations have been updated. (#587, #616)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:68
msgid ""
"This is the fourth beta release of Paper Plane 0.1.0 with new features and "
"bug fixes:"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:70
msgid ""
"Paper Plane now uses some new shiny widgets from libadwaita 1.4, thanks to "
"@melix99. (#518)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:71
msgid ""
"The tdlib telegram client library has been updated to 1.8.19, thanks to "
"@alissonlauffer. (#577)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:72
msgid ""
"The login flow has been completely redesigned and now looks more modern. "
"(#510)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:73
msgid ""
"We have redesigned the session switcher. It has been moved to the sidebar "
"and shows a confirmation dialog when logging out. (#510)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:74
msgid ""
"The message entry can now be clicked without effecting the state of the "
"application window. (#510)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:75
msgid "Displaying location and venue messages is now implemented. (#548, #582)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:76
msgid "Fixed an application crash when trying to log in. (#559)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:77
msgid ""
"A mask is now used for the document message status indicator, thanks to "
"@yuraiz. (#555)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:78
msgid ""
"The dialog for sending media files has been improved in function and "
"appearance, thanks to @melix99. (#540)"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:79
#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:89
#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:103
msgid "Dependencies have been updated."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:80
msgid "Translations have been updated."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:86
msgid ""
"The third beta release of Paper Plane 0.1.0 should in the first place fix a "
"build error on Flathub:"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:88
msgid ""
"Added registered categories to the desktop file to fix a build error on "
"Flathub."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:90
msgid "Turkish translations have been updated, thanks to @sabriunal."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:96
msgid ""
"The second beta release of Paper Plane 0.1.0 contains the following "
"features, fixes and chores:"
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:98
msgid ""
"Blueprint compiler has been updated to version 0.8.1, thanks to "
"@alissonlauffer."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:99
msgid ""
"The chat history now has a background image, which is animated when new "
"messages arrive, thanks to @yuraiz."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:100
msgid ""
"A bug was fixed that lead to an application crash if selecting non-existing "
"chats from the contacts window, thank to @alissonlauffer."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:101
msgid ""
"Avatars of deleted accounts now have a ghost icon set, thanks to @karl0d."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:102
msgid ""
"The application will now be built with more aggressive compiler options, "
"which should result in a smaller and maybe faster binary."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:104
msgid ""
"Portuguese and Polish translation have been updated, thanks to "
"@jvlianodorneles and @karl0d."
msgstr ""

#: data/app.drey.PaperPlane.metainfo.xml.in.in:110
msgid ""
"Paper Plane 0.1.0-beta.1 is the first release for enthusiasts to try out and "
"play around with."
msgstr ""

